#: controllers/Overview.php:78
msgid "Secure WP Paths"
msgstr "保护WP路径"

#: controllers/Overview.php:79
msgid ""
"Customize & Secure all WordPress paths (login, core, plugins, themes) so "
"hacker bots can’t find your entry points or exploit known vulnerabilities."
msgstr ""
"自定义并保护所有WordPress路径（登录、核心、插件、主题），防止黑客机器人发现入"
"口或利用已知漏洞。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:91
msgid "Hide WP Common Paths"
msgstr "隐藏WP常用路径"

#: controllers/Overview.php:92
msgid ""
"Hide default WordPress paths like /wp-content and /wp-includes so automated "
"hacker bots can’t detect your site structure."
msgstr ""
"隐藏/wp-content和/wp-includes等默认WordPress路径，防止自动化机器人探测您的网"
"站结构。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:104
msgid "Hide WP Common Files"
msgstr "隐藏WP常用文件"

#: controllers/Overview.php:105
msgid ""
"Block access to sensitive files (wp-config.php, readme, install files) that "
"attackers use to gather information about your site."
msgstr ""
"阻止访问攻击者用于收集网站信息的敏感文件（wp-config.php、readme、安装文件"
"等）。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:118
msgid "2FA"
msgstr "双重验证"

#: controllers/Overview.php:119 view/Twofactor.php:65
msgid ""
"Add a second verification step via authenticator app, email code, or passkey "
"(Face ID, Touch ID), so a stolen password alone can't unlock your site."
msgstr ""
"通过验证器应用、邮件验证码或密钥（Face ID、Touch ID）添加第二步验证，使盗取的"
"密码单独无法解锁网站。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:132 models/Brute.php:223
msgid "Brute Force Protection"
msgstr "暴力破解防护"

#: controllers/Overview.php:133 view/Brute.php:61
msgid ""
"Stop repeated login attempts and block bots trying to guess usernames and "
"passwords."
msgstr "阻止反复登录尝试，拦截试图猜测用户名和密码的机器人。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:145
msgid "WooCommerce Safe Login"
msgstr "WooCommerce安全登录"

#: controllers/Overview.php:146
msgid ""
"Protect customer accounts from brute force attacks and credential stuffing."
msgstr "保护客户账户免受暴力破解和撞库攻击。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:159 models/Menu.php:57 models/Menu.php:254
#: view/Firewall.php:34
msgid "Firewall"
msgstr "防火墙"

#: controllers/Overview.php:160
msgid ""
"Block malicious requests, SQL injections, and exploit attempts before they "
"reach your website."
msgstr "在恶意请求、SQL注入和漏洞利用尝试到达网站之前将其拦截。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:173 view/Firewall.php:445
msgid "Country Blocking"
msgstr "国家封锁"

#: controllers/Overview.php:174 view/Firewall.php:448
msgid ""
"Block traffic from high-risk countries to reduce hacking attempts, spam, and "
"unwanted access."
msgstr "封锁来自高风险国家的流量，减少黑客攻击、垃圾邮件和不必要访问。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:186 models/Menu.php:234 view/Templogin.php:35
msgid "Temporary Logins"
msgstr "临时登录"

#: controllers/Overview.php:187 view/Templogin.php:70
msgid ""
"Create secure, time-limited access links without sharing usernames or "
"passwords for a limited period of time."
msgstr "创建安全的限时访问链接，无需共享用户名或密码。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:199 view/Permalinks.php:726
msgid "Magic Link Login"
msgstr "魔法链接登录"

#: controllers/Overview.php:200
msgid ""
"Allow passwordless login using a secure link sent by email, reducing the "
"risk of stolen credentials."
msgstr "通过邮件发送安全链接实现无密码登录，降低凭据泄露风险。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:212 models/Menu.php:228 view/Tweaks.php:819
msgid "Login Page Design"
msgstr "登录页面设计"

#: controllers/Overview.php:213 view/Tweaks.php:832
msgid ""
"Customize your login page design while keeping it aligned with your secured "
"login path and branding."
msgstr "自定义登录页面设计，与安全登录路径和品牌风格保持一致。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:226 models/Menu.php:194 models/Presets.php:115
#: view/Mapping.php:35
msgid "Text Mapping"
msgstr "文本映射"

#: controllers/Overview.php:227
msgid ""
"Replace WordPress-specific class names and IDs in your page source so "
"scanners can't fingerprint your site as WordPress."
msgstr ""
"替换页面源码中WordPress特有的类名和ID，使扫描器无法将网站识别为WordPress。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:239 models/Menu.php:198 models/Presets.php:117
#: view/Mapping.php:173
msgid "URL Mapping"
msgstr "URL映射"

#: controllers/Overview.php:240
msgid ""
"Rewrite CSS and JS file URLs to custom paths, removing default WordPress "
"signatures that bots use to identify your setup."
msgstr ""
"将CSS和JS文件URL重写为自定义路径，移除机器人用于识别WordPress安装的默认标识。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:252 models/Menu.php:202
msgid "CDN Mapping"
msgstr "CDN映射"

#: controllers/Overview.php:253
msgid ""
"Load CSS, JS, and images from a CDN or custom domain while keeping your real "
"server paths invisible."
msgstr "从CDN或自定义域名加载CSS、JS和图片，同时隐藏真实的服务器路径。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:265 models/Presets.php:125 view/Log.php:28
#: view/Log.php:216
msgid "Security Threats Log"
msgstr "安全威胁日志"

#: controllers/Overview.php:266
msgid ""
"See real attacks blocked on your site, including brute force attempts, "
"injections, and bot scans."
msgstr "查看网站上被拦截的真实攻击，包括暴力破解、注入和机器人扫描。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:278 view/Firewall.php:114
msgid "Automate IP Blocking"
msgstr "自动IP封锁"

#: controllers/Overview.php:279
msgid ""
"Automatically block IPs that trigger repeated attacks, stopping threats "
"without manual intervention."
msgstr "自动封锁触发重复攻击的IP，无需手动干预即可阻止威胁。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:291 models/Presets.php:123
msgid "User Events Log"
msgstr "用户事件日志"

#: controllers/Overview.php:292
msgid ""
"Log user logins, content edits, plugin changes, and role updates so you can "
"spot suspicious behavior and audit site activity."
msgstr ""
"记录用户登录、内容编辑、插件变更和角色更新，便于发现可疑行为并审计网站活动。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:304
msgid "Login & Logout Redirects"
msgstr "登录和退出重定向"

#: controllers/Overview.php:305
msgid ""
"Redirect users to custom pages after login or logout based on their role. "
"e.g., send editors to the dashboard and customers to their account."
msgstr ""
"根据角色在登录或退出后重定向到自定义页面，例如将编辑重定向到仪表盘，客户重定"
"向到账户页面。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:318 models/Menu.php:258 view/Firewall.php:244
msgid "Header Security"
msgstr "响应头安全"

#: controllers/Overview.php:319
msgid ""
"Add security headers to protect against XSS, clickjacking, and code "
"injection attacks."
msgstr "添加安全响应头，防范XSS、点击劫持和代码注入攻击。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:331
msgid "Feed Security"
msgstr "订阅源安全"

#: controllers/Overview.php:332
msgid ""
"Replace default WordPress paths inside RSS feeds so bots crawling your feed "
"can't map your site structure."
msgstr "替换RSS订阅源中的默认WordPress路径，防止爬虫绘制网站结构图。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:344
msgid "Sitemap Security"
msgstr "站点地图安全"

#: controllers/Overview.php:345
msgid ""
"Replace WordPress paths in your XML sitemap so attackers scanning it can't "
"identify your plugins, themes, or directory structure."
msgstr ""
"替换XML站点地图中的WordPress路径，使扫描者无法识别插件、主题或目录结构。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:357
msgid "Robots Security"
msgstr "Robots安全"

#: controllers/Overview.php:358
msgid ""
"Clean up robots.txt so it doesn't accidentally reveal WordPress paths like /"
"wp-admin or /wp-content to scanners."
msgstr ""
"清理robots.txt，防止其意外向扫描器泄露/wp-admin或/wp-content等WordPress路径。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:370
msgid "Admin Toolbar"
msgstr "管理员工具栏"

#: controllers/Overview.php:371
msgid ""
"Hide the WordPress admin toolbar for specific user roles to keep the backend "
"less visible to non-admins."
msgstr "为特定用户角色隐藏WordPress管理员工具栏，使非管理员用户不易察觉后台。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:383 view/Tweaks.php:520
msgid "Disable Right-Click"
msgstr "禁用右键菜单"

#: controllers/Overview.php:384
msgid ""
"Disable right-click context menus to discourage casual content theft and "
"source code inspection."
msgstr "禁用右键快捷菜单，阻止随意复制内容和查看源代码。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:396
msgid "Disable Copy/Paste"
msgstr "禁用复制/粘贴"

#: controllers/Overview.php:397
msgid ""
"Block copy, paste, and drag actions to make it harder for visitors to scrape "
"your content."
msgstr "阻止复制、粘贴和拖拽操作，使访客更难抓取您的内容。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:411
msgid "Wordfence Security"
msgstr "Wordfence Security"

#: controllers/Overview.php:412
msgid ""
"Compatible with Wordfence Security plugin. Use them together for Malware "
"Scan, Firewall, Brute Force protection."
msgstr ""
"兼容Wordfence Security插件，可配合使用恶意软件扫描、防火墙和暴力破解防护。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:424
msgid "All In One WP Security"
msgstr "All In One WP Security"

#: controllers/Overview.php:425
msgid ""
"Compatible with All In One WP Security plugin. Use them together for Virus "
"Scan, Firewall, Brute Force protection."
msgstr ""
"兼容All In One WP Security插件，可配合使用病毒扫描、防火墙和暴力破解防护。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:437
msgid "Sucuri Security"
msgstr "Sucuri Security"

#: controllers/Overview.php:438
msgid ""
"Compatible with Sucuri Security plugin. Use them together for Virus Scan, "
"Firewall, File Integrity Monitoring."
msgstr "兼容Sucuri Security插件，可配合使用病毒扫描、防火墙和文件完整性监控。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:450
msgid "Solid Security"
msgstr "Solid Security"

#: controllers/Overview.php:451
msgid ""
"Compatible with Solid Security plugin. Use them together for Site Scanner, "
"File Change Detection, Brute Force Protection."
msgstr ""
"兼容Solid Security插件，可配合使用站点扫描、文件变更检测和暴力破解防护。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:464
msgid "Autoptimize"
msgstr "Autoptimize"

#: controllers/Overview.php:465
