"Minify CSS and JS files."
msgstr "完全兼容Cache Enabler插件，建议开启压缩CSS和JS文件选项。"

#: controllers/Overview.php:516
msgid "WP Rocket"
msgstr "WP Rocket"

#: controllers/Overview.php:517
